  {
   "id": "g1-maths-08-02",
   "title": "Tens and ones",
   "learn": {
    "hook": "Every big number has a tens part and a ones part!",
    "points": [
     "In 34, the 3 means 3 tens. The 4 means 4 ones.",
     "3 tens and 4 ones make 30 + 4 = 34.",
     "The left digit shows tens. The right digit shows ones.",
     "45 and 54 are different numbers!"
